{"unit_id": "tag:03R0:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n接下来的任务是计算平展上同调（<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology），对于光滑（smooth）曲线（curve），定义在代数闭（algebraically closed）域（field）上，具有挠（torsion）系数（coefficients），特别要证明它在至少为3的次数（degree）上消没（vanishes）。为证明这一点，将计算上同调（cohomology），在泛点（generic point）处，这归结为某些伽罗瓦（Galois）上同调（cohomology）。\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology", "target_term": "平展上同调"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "curve", "target_term": "曲线"}, {"source_term": "algebraically closed", "target_term": "代数闭"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "挠"}, {"source_term": "coefficients", "target_term": "系数"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "vanishes", "target_term": "消没"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "Galois", "target_term": "伽罗瓦"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology", "target_term": "平展上同调", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "curve", "target_term": "曲线", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "algebraically closed", "target_term": "代数闭", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "挠", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "coefficients", "target_term": "系数", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "vanishes", "target_term": "消没", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "