{"unit_id": "tag:03R1:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n前一个引理蕴含逆元（inverses）存在，且<MATH_0001>。布劳尔群（Brauer group），对于域（field），总是挠（torsion）的。事实上，将看到<MATH_0002>具有整除<MATH_0003>的阶（order），对于任意有限（finite）中心（central）单（simple）代数（algebra）<MATH_0004>（见引理<REF_0001>）。一般来说，布劳尔群（Brauer group）不是有限生成（finitely generated）的，例如，布劳尔群（Brauer group），对于非阿基米德（non-Archimedean）局部（local）域（field），是<MATH_0005>。布劳尔群（Brauer group），对于<MATH_0006>，不可数（uncountable）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "inverses", "target_term": "逆元"}, {"source_term": "Brauer group", "target_term": "布劳尔群"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "挠"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "central", "target_term": "中心"}, {"source_term": "simple", "target_term": "单"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Brauer group", "target_term": "布劳尔群"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成"}, {"source_term": "Brauer group", "target_term": "布劳尔群"}, {"source_term": "non-Archimedean", "target_term": "非阿基米德"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "Brauer group", "target_term": "布劳尔群"}, {"source_term": "uncountable", "target_term": "不可数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "inverses", "target_term": "逆元", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "Brauer group", "target_term": "布劳尔群", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "挠", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "order", "target_term": "阶", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "central", "target_term": "中心", "context": "曲线上同调与布劳尔群；译法待批准。"}, {"source_term": "simple", "target_term": "单",